            <span class="highlight-number">01</span>
            <h3 class="highlight-title">IP67 Rugged Enclosure</h3>
            <p class="highlight-body">Fully sealed industrial enclosure rated IP67. Designed for environments with dust, moisture, vibration, and continuous operation demands that would disqualify lab-grade detectors.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-card reveal" data-delay="60">
            <span class="highlight-number">02</span>
            <h3 class="highlight-title">No Active Cooling</h3>
            <p class="highlight-body">No Peltiers, no cooling circuits. Industrial IP67 TDI operates within its full specification across 10–40 °C without active thermal management — reducing system complexity and failure modes. This is enabled by very low power consumption and the embedded dynamic offset calibration algorithm.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-card reveal" data-delay="120">
            <span class="highlight-number">03</span>
            <h3 class="highlight-title">Ultra-Fast TDI Scanning</h3>
            <p class="highlight-body">TDI mode with line rates up to 75,000 lps. Designed for very high scanning speeds — 30 m/min at 100 µm, 240 m/min at 200 µm, and up to 1920 m/min at 400 µm resolution (or 115 km/h scanning speed).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-card reveal" data-delay="60">
