            <h3 class="highlight-title">Direct Conversion CdTe</h3>
            <p class="highlight-body">CdTe direct conversion imaging with 28 TDI stages. Exceptionally high sensitivity, wide energy range (10–360 kV), and 16-bit dynamic range for demanding inspection applications. We also offer a custom solution for LINACs for use at energies up to 9 MeV.</p>
          </div>
