            <span class="highlight-number">05</span>
            <h3 class="highlight-title">High Contrast &amp; Sensitivity</h3>
            <p class="highlight-body">Single-photon-sensitive TDI performance. Superior contrast resolution enables reliable detection of small foreign objects, fine structural defects, and low-attenuation features.</p>
